  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are able to block damage to multiple targets at once.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Cushion the Blow.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can share the effect of Cushion the Blow, Greater Cushion the Blow, and Improved Cushion the Blow to a number of members of your collective equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p>In addition, if you expend one use of mythic power, you can use Cushion the Blow as a free action even if it is not your turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Using Cushion the Blow is an immediate action and only applies to a single member of your collective.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
